      <mxCell id="note-keys" value="In Silver, &lt;b&gt;prd_key&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;cat_id&lt;/b&gt; are both derived from the Bronze &lt;b&gt;prd_key&lt;/b&gt; (the first 5 characters give the category, the rest is the product key). The ERP &lt;b&gt;cid&lt;/b&gt; values are cleaned (the NAS prefix and the dashes are removed) so they match &lt;b&gt;cst_key&lt;/b&gt;." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="715" width="1190" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root>
